menu "Claw Diagnose Capability"

config CLAW_CAP_DIAGNOSE_RING_CAPACITY
    int "In-memory log ring capacity (entries)"
    default 64
    range 16 256
    help
        How many recent log lines are retained in heap for cap_diagnose
        to surface to the LLM. Older entries are overwritten when full.

config CLAW_CAP_DIAGNOSE_MAX_LINE_LEN
    int "Per-log-line max length (bytes)"
    default 240
    range 96 512
    help
        Each captured log line is truncated to this length. Lower values
        reduce heap pressure at the cost of losing tail context.

endmenu
